OnBytes/Field/TestField.lean: tests of OnBytes/Field/Word.lean and OnBytes/Field/Ext.lean.

The expected values were computed outside Lean with arbitrary-precision integers. There the product
in E is a convolution followed by a reduction, and the inverse in E is the power with the exponent
p^3 - 2, a different formula from the one under test. Operands in F: all pairs of eleven words at
the borders (some not below p; pairs with p - 1 recur), then words from a linear congruential
generator. In E: such words, then five rows chosen by hand. The program does not import this file.
-/
